{"id":"9e0348ed2298c600","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-bochner-integral.md","title":"Bochner Integral","display":"df-bochner-integral — Bochner Integral","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-bochner-integral","aliases":["58-df-bochner-integral","Bochner Integral"],"display":"df-bochner-integral — Bochner Integral","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[58-df-banach-space]]","[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-bochner-integral"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-bochner-integral</span><span>Bochner Integral</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bochner-integral — Bochner Integral"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ef59807ad934771f\" href=\"?note=ef59807ad934771f\" title=\"58-df-banach-space\">58-df-banach-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,E,\\mathcal E,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|,f,L\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,E,\\mathcal E,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|,f,L\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\">\\(K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+:E\\times E\\to E\">\\(+:E\\times E\\to E\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot:K\\times E\\to E\">\\(\\cdot:K\\times E\\to E\\)</span> 为指定运算。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_+\">\\(\\mathcal B_+\\)</span> 是书内 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExtendedNonnegativeBorel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ExtendedNonnegativeBorel}_S\\)</span> 唯一确定的扩展非负实 Borel 结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\int_Xd\\,d\\mu\">\\(\\int_Xd\\,d\\mu\\)</span> 使用所引非负积分定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>二元运算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(a,b)\">\\(q(a,b)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\">\\(q(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u-v\">\\(u-v\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+(u,\\cdot(-1_K,v))\">\\(+(u,\\cdot(-1_K,v))\\)</span>；非负实标量在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=\\mathbb C\">\\(K=\\mathbb C\\)</span> 时用通常实子域嵌入。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_n=s_\\bullet(n)\">\\(s_n=s_\\bullet(n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_n=d_\\bullet(n)\">\\(d_n=d_\\bullet(n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_n=r_\\bullet(n)\">\\(r_n=r_\\bullet(n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_n=J_\\bullet(n)\">\\(J_n=J_\\bullet(n)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_E\">\\(0_E\\)</span> 在正文中约束为加法单位元。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteVectorSumValue}_{58}\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteVectorSumValue}_{58}\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> 为正文的有限折叠关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S\\subseteq V^{11}\">\\(\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S\\subseteq V^{11}\\)</span> 保持原参数顺序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Banach}\">\\(\\mathrm{Banach}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ef59807ad934771f\" href=\"?note=ef59807ad934771f\" title=\"58-df-banach-space\">58-df-banach-space</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FiniteVectorSumValue}_{58}(J,B,w,E,+,0_E)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n0_E\\in E\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+,E\\times E,E)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(w,B,E)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists b,u\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Bijective}(b,m,B)\\land u\\in E^{m+1}\\land u(0)=0_E\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{22mm}\\land\\forall i\\in m\\;u(i+1)=+(u(i),w(b(i)))\\land J=u(m)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FiniteVectorSumValue}_{58}(J,B,w,E,+,0_E)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n0_E\\in E\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+,E\\times E,E)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(w,B,E)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists b,u\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Bijective}(b,m,B)\\land u\\in E^{m+1}\\land u(0)=0_E\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{22mm}\\land\\forall i\\in m\\;u(i+1)=+(u(i),w(b(i)))\\land J=u(m)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bochner\\text{-}integral}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S(L,f,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,E,\\mathcal E,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Banach}_S(E,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),(E,\\mathcal E))\\land L\\in E\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists0_E\\in E\\;\\exists s_\\bullet\\in(E^X)^\\omega\\;\n\\exists d_\\bullet\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^X)^\\omega\\;\n\\exists r_\\bullet\\in[0,\\infty]^\\omega\\;\\exists J_\\bullet\\in E^\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall a\\in E\\;(+(0_E,a)=a\\land+(a,0_E)=a)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(s_n;(X,\\mathcal F),(E,\\mathcal E))\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\operatorname{ran}(s_n))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{ran}(s_n)\\;\n\\bigl(s_n^{-1}[\\{a\\}]\\in\\mathcal F\\land(a\\neq0_E\\to\\mu(s_n^{-1}[\\{a\\}])&lt;\\infty)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;d_n(x)=\\|f(x)-s_n(x)\\|\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(d_n;(X,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\n\\land r_n=\\int_Xd_n\\,d\\mu\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{FiniteVectorSumValue}_{58}\\Bigl(\nJ_n,\\operatorname{ran}(s_n)\\setminus\\{0_E\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\{\\langle a,\\cdot(\\mu(s_n^{-1}[\\{a\\}]),a)\\rangle:\na\\in\\operatorname{ran}(s_n)\\setminus\\{0_E\\}\\},E,+,0_E\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(n\\geq N\\to r_n&lt;\\varepsilon\\land\\|J_n-L\\|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bochner\\text{-}integral}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S(L,f,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,E,\\mathcal E,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Banach}_S(E,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),(E,\\mathcal E))\\land L\\in E\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists0_E\\in E\\;\\exists s_\\bullet\\in(E^X)^\\omega\\;\n\\exists d_\\bullet\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^X)^\\omega\\;\n\\exists r_\\bullet\\in[0,\\infty]^\\omega\\;\\exists J_\\bullet\\in E^\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall a\\in E\\;(+(0_E,a)=a\\land+(a,0_E)=a)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(s_n;(X,\\mathcal F),(E,\\mathcal E))\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\operatorname{ran}(s_n))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{ran}(s_n)\\;\n\\bigl(s_n^{-1}[\\{a\\}]\\in\\mathcal F\\land(a\\neq0_E\\to\\mu(s_n^{-1}[\\{a\\}])&lt;\\infty)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;d_n(x)=\\|f(x)-s_n(x)\\|\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(d_n;(X,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\n\\land r_n=\\int_Xd_n\\,d\\mu\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{FiniteVectorSumValue}_{58}\\Bigl(\nJ_n,\\operatorname{ran}(s_n)\\setminus\\{0_E\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\{\\langle a,\\cdot(\\mu(s_n^{-1}[\\{a\\}]),a)\\rangle:\na\\in\\operatorname{ran}(s_n)\\setminus\\{0_E\\}\\},E,+,0_E\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(n\\geq N\\to r_n&lt;\\varepsilon\\land\\|J_n-L\\|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bochner integral: extension of Lebesgue integral to Banach spaces</li>\n<li>Pettis integral: weaker, based on duality</li>\n<li>Strong measurability: almost sure limit of simple functions</li>\n<li>Dominated convergence: if <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|f_n| \\leq g\">\\(|f_n| \\leq g\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_n \\to f\">\\(f_n \\to f\\)</span> a.e. then <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\int f_n \\to \\int f\">\\(\\int f_n \\to \\int f\\)</span></li>\n<li>Itô integration: Bochner integral with respect to martingales</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Diestel and Uhl, Vector Measures</li>\n<li>Yosida, Functional Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-banach-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef59807ad934771f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-banach-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","head